WEBVTT

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.720
<b>Yo, yo, yonaka ni bakko suru chimi mouryou</b>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.720
<i>Yo, yo, at midnight evil spirits stalk</i>

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.760
<b>Marude ikaino ichimi routou</b>

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.760
<i>As if they're from another world</i>

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.010
<b>Mitai na rhymer rhyme shini toujou</b>

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.010
<i>Come to rhyme rhymes</i>

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.180
<b>Kikoetarou? Yamini hibiku oto</b>

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.180
<i>Can you hear them? The sounds resonating from the darkness</i>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.520
<b>Bibitte kyomi nai furi shiyouto</b>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.520
<i>Scared senseless, but you pretend not to be interested</i>

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.480
<b>Koukishin wa hini hini jyoushou</b>

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.480
<i>Your curiosity grows day by day</i>

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.770
<b>Nara check shini ikou, here we, here we go ya'll!</b>

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.770
<i>So let's go check them out, here we, here we go ya'll</i>

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.980
<b>Ayashi ayaushi shima no chimi mouryou</b>

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.980
<i>The mysterious and dangerous evil spirits</i>

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:44.650
<b>Tabun jigoku wa manpai</b>

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:44.650
<i>Hell is probably full with evil spirits</i>

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.940
<b>Afure dashita renchuu ga dantai de retsu wo nashite</b>

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.940
<i>Those that can't get in march in a line</i>

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.150
<b>Kono yo ni stand-by</b>

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.150
<i>Waiting on stand-by in this world</i>

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.360
<b>Yatsura no bun basho ga mazu tannai</b>

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.360
<i>There aren't any spaces left for them</i>

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.620
<b>Dooride kisetsu towazu atsui hazu</b>

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.620
<i>No wonder, no matter what the season is, it's always hot</i>

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>Aete heat up sasu ikatsui verse wo</b>

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:56.240
<i>Purposely heating you up with hot verses</i>

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.950
<b>Kamashite ase kakasuzo</b>

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.950
<i>That make you sweat</i>

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.710
<b>Douse yakedaro kikasena gasshou wo yo!</b>

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.710
<i>You might as well let us hear you all sing!</i>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.790
<b>HA! Koitsuwa marude kajiba</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.790
<i>HA! It's just like a scene of a fire</i>

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.170
<b>Sugee nekki tamacchimau shimaguni</b>

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.170
<i>The excitement in the air heats up this island country</i>

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.300
<b>DANGER! Masu masu agacchimau COME ON!</b>

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.300
<i>DANGER! The tension keeps building COME ON!</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.550
<b>(Kono Jipangu mouchoi de panku!)</b>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.550
<i>(This Japan is about to explode!)</i>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.680
<b>HA! Koitsuwa marude kajiba</b>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.680
<i>HA! It's just like a scene of a fire</i>

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.970
<b>Sugee nekki tamacchimau shimaguni</b>

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.970
<i>The excitement in the air heats up this island country</i>

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.180
<b>DANGER! Masu masu agacchimau COME ON!</b>

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.180
<i>DANGER! The tension keeps building COME ON!</i>

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.390
<b>(Kono Jipangu mouchoi de panku!)</b>

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.390
<i>(This Japan is about to explode!)</i>

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:21.890
And this.

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:27.730
A medicine that my master,
Ito Kihei, asked me to bring you.

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:30.950
It's good for the
postpartum recovery period.

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:33.030
Please have your wife try it.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:37.040
Thank him for his generosity.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:40.370
Please Master Tamiya,
I hope you'll honor the Ito Family

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.920
with a visit sometime.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.630
I will come to pay my respects.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:47.960
Then we'll be looking forward
to you calling.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.180
Lady Oiwa, I have your medicine
ready here for you.

00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:57.930
Master Ito sent his best wishes
and medicine for me?

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.600
Please offer him my thanks.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.190
I'd feel awkward doing that.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.270
She's right.
It's best that you go.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:09.480
In that case,
take Akiyama with you.

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:12.150
I'll bring your haori out for you.

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:16.120
We're living like peasants here
and we still have a haori?

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.330
I am the wife of a samurai, after all.

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:24.170
Well, I'm on my way.

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:28.420
Please give my deepest
thanks to Master Ito.

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:36.470
It seems to me that lemon's
been somewhat cool towards you.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:39.930
What a shame, seeing as you've
given him a child and all.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.140
He's actually a warm
person deep down.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.350
It's just that he's now a ronin.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.400
I suppose that's how it is.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:52.940
Ito Kihei has prospered
under Kira's vassalage.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:55.200
Becoming close to him
might benefit you.

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:58.240
Lady Oiwa, now please
take your medicine.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.280
Yes.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:01.490
This will probably
make me feel better.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.000
It's bitter.

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:07.130
So glad you came to visit.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.920
They say that good medicine
tastes bitter.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.260
I suppose.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:30.570
My throat!

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.360
My throat is burning!

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:40.870
Lady Oiwa! What's the matter?!

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:51.040
I curse you, lemon!

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:56.130
Act Two

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:01.430
My name was
Tsuruya Nanboku the Fourth.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:07.600
The Kabuki play I wrote,
Tokaido Yotsuya Kaidan,

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:12.190
was based on
a well-known ghost story.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:16.190
It is said that Oiwa,
the daughter of Yotsuya Samon,

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:18.530
was a strong willed girl
who had survived small pox

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:20.570
when she was a young girl.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.280
In order to prevent
her family's demise,

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:27.830
she took a husband,
a ronin named Tamiya lemon.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:32.210
However, due to Ito Kihei's trickery,

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:35.090
she was unjustly separated
from her husband.

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:40.010
Oiwa was deeply hurt and
became emotionally unstable.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:43.430
She ran through the streets of Edo,
screaming like a madwoman,

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.020
and then vanished
without a trace.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:48.980
After that,

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:55.230
18 members of the houses
of Tamiya and Ito died.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:59.530
Some claimed that
this was the curse of Oiwa.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:05.910
The Kabuki play I wrote does not
follow the curse of Oiwa as such.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:10.620
So is this tale,
Tokaido Yotsuya Kaidan,

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:16.050
actually a story that I created?

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:25.600
No, please.

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:28.140
There's no need to be so formal.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:33.400
Please make yourself comfortable.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:34.440
Oume!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:37.280
Aren't you going to fill
Master lemon's cup?

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:38.730
Here you are.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:39.990
Thank you.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.620
This is my granddaughter, Oume.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:55.920
Perhaps because she lost
her parents at a young age,

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.920
it seems I've spoiled her such that
she has become very demanding.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:05.340
Once she sees something she likes,
she's not content until it's hers.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:07.760
Here you are.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:10.180
Please help yourself.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.310
Thank you.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:14.850
What the...?!

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.400
Look, Tamiya.

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:23.360
For you, Tamiya,
I've prepared a separate gift.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:29.330
Goodness...

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.750
I don't recall doing anything for you

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.750
that merits such a reward.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.500
Truth is,

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:41.090
it seems that my granddaughter
is quite smitten with you.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.100
Master Tamiya.

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:51.100
Would you consider
marriage to Oume?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.270
I've brought you some water!

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:05.700
Lady Oiwa!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.410
Water...

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:08.820
More water!

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.490
Yes! Right away!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:25.760
You have a wife of course.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:31.140
But I understand she's been
unwell since giving birth.

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:35.430
Even so, I cannot simply leave
her without a good reason.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:38.060
Then you mean it's impossible?

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:42.400
If so, Master Tamiya,
please kill me right now.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:44.240
What are you saying?

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:48.740
Well, the medicine that Maki
brought over earlier...

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:52.120
I was told it was good
for postpartum recovery.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:54.160
That medicine...

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:06.800
Here's some water!

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:17.310
Although it isn't fatal,

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:22.190
it's a poison that will disfigure
the face of one who takes it.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.780
What are you saying?!

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:30.200
Like I told you,
I indulge the girl.

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:37.660
If you are willing to marry
my granddaughter,

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:41.000
I will surrender
the Ito assets to you.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.290
I beg you.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:45.170
If you won't do it,
I'll kill myself right here!

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:47.800
Oh, Miss Oume!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.180
Miss Oume!

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:51.590
Please don't do it, Miss Oume!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:52.890
Tamiya.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:55.890
Rejecting his offer would
be a terrible mistake.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:03.360
Oh!

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:05.400
So you've agreed!

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:07.610
What an auspicious day it is!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.820
We can hold the tentative ceremony
this very evening!

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:18.540
Damn it!

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:21.580
Welcome home.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.880
How are you feeling?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.380
How's the medicine?

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:28.170
After I took that medicine,

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.340
for some reason
my face began to feel hot.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.430
And the pain...

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:37.850
Probably some kind of side effect.

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:39.680
But you seem better.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.770
Not so.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:45.230
I doubt I have much longer to live.

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:48.190
I'm not afraid of dying,

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.400
but I can't help feeling
sorry for my child.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:56.740
If I were to die, please promise
me that you won't remarry.

00:09:57.580 --> 00:09:59.080
Remarry?

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:01.500
I'm about to wed my second wife.

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:03.960
How can you be so cruel?!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.590
She's much younger and more
beautiful than you are.

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:13.840
I'm taking the comb.
You won't...

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:15.090
No, you won't!

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.260
This is an heirloom
my mother gave me.

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:21.100
Father's death has
yet to be avenged!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:24.400
It's about time
you give up on that.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:25.600
How could you?!

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:27.690
We're husband and wife.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.570
You said we'd find his killer!

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:33.070
The way things are now,
it's pointless to talk about revenge.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.240
I've grown tired of all of this.

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.950
If you can't accept that, then leave.

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.290
You want to separate?

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:41.910
What about our baby?

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.080
I don't want the kid!

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:45.500
You're willing to abandon our child?

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:54.720
Kohei! Keep it down in there!

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:58.800
Oh, Master Tamiya!

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:01.140
I was out getting oil
for the lantern.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:04.480
Something's happened
to Lady Oiwa!

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:08.650
It's because of the medicine
we got from the Ito family.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:09.400
What?!

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:10.820
How do you know that?

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.450
Tonight,

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:17.280
I'm exchanging wedding vows
with Ito's granddaughter.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.820
Pardon?!

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:20.490
Takuetsu,

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:23.160
you've always had feelings
for Oiwa, haven't you?

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:26.250
What?! I'd never
be so presumptuous!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.670
Do as you like with her.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:33.460
What's this?!

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:35.800
Get Oiwa to be unfaithful.

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:39.850
I need her thrown out
of the house before dawn.

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:44.350
If things don't go well,

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.310
I don't care if you kill her.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:13.210
Master Tamiya said
that he would be late tonight.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:17.130
Allow me to give you a massage.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:36.400
Lady Oiwa!

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:39.200
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.410
What are you trying to do
to the wife of a samurai!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:49.620
Master Tamiya no longer
loves you, Lady Oiwa.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.540
So how about considering
possibilities with me?

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.770
You disrespectful bastard!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:11.560
Please don't, Lady Oiwa!

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:24.160
Lady Oiwa!

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.120
Please forgive me!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:33.250
I only did it because
your husband ordered me to!

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.300
lemon did?!

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.260
The medicine the
Ito family sent over...

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:43.590
It was meant
to disfigure your face.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.930
It was poison.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.960
So this is my face?

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:26.350
It was all planned so that Oume,

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:31.020
the Ito patriarch's granddaughter,
could be married to your husband.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.830
I'm going to the Ito house to thank them
for what they've done.

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.330
Takuetsu, bring my teeth
blackening kit!

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:51.700
What?

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.410
You mustn't blacken your teeth!

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.920
You've only just given
birth to a child!

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:04.090
I can at least make
myself attractive.

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:26.030
I must at least retain
my dignity as a woman.

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:28.490
And comb my hair.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.160
I must go give them my thanks.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.520
If I die now,

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:05.190
lemon will be bound in
matrimony to that Oume.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:14.080
I will hold a grudge
against you, lemon!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:19.630
You will never live this down!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.180
Lady Oiwa...!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:54.830
Cats are forbidden
near the dead.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:56.080
Go on! Shoo!

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:10.050
I can't stay in this place
any longer!

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:13.470
M-Master Tamiya!

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.680
Takuetsu.

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:15.970
Have you killed her?

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.930
No! I didn't do anything!

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:28.400
Lady Oiwa died a tragic death,
and it's all your fault!

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:29.490
Kohei!

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:32.820
I'll consider keeping
your crimes a secret.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.030
In exchange for
the Soukisei medicine.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:36.740
Kobotoke Kohei,

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.700
I can't let you live.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:02.730
Throw the door into the river.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:05.440
Let them think
they died for their love.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.360
Don't forget your promise to me.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:08.480
Of course not.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:12.240
Excuse us, Tamiya!
We're early!

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.280
My, my, if it isn't Master Ito.

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:16.740
I realize we may seem hasty,

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:21.660
it's just that Oume was insistent
on moving in right away!

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:37.640
Master Tamiya,

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:39.220
where's your wife?

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.560
She abandoned the baby,

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:45.560
and ran off somewhere
with my manservant Kohei.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.150
Is that so?

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:50.780
Then why don't you let Maki and
I look after the child in her place.

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:18.640
Oume.

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:21.770
